		<outline text="Happy Birthday email">
			<outline text=" David A. Roman 	

David@romanda.org &lt;mailto:David@romanda.org&gt; to adam
	 More options	  12:12 pm (3½ hours ago)


Its so wild your birthday is 9/3/64.. Lets see why.


1. My Brother's birthday is 9/3/55
2. My Son's Birthday is 9/3/95
3. My birthday is 11/20/64


I wanted to tell you Happy Birthday and Keep the DSC coming!!!
My Brother and I work together for a company that sells and maintains the control systems for about 50% of the power plants in the USA.


He turned me onto podcasts in January and the first 2 weeks we were in FLA on a job site, we car-pooled into the plant and listened to you every day.  It was really a great time.  We LOVE  'da hit test, it’s a blast.   We both have iPods and have so many podcasts on them we cant listen to them all.  I look forward to the DSC more then any of the others, it is still by far the best.   Mark (my brother)'s son just started College and My son Just started 5th grade, and listening to you with Christiana is a blast.  The new line for the office is &quot;This sucks so bad it swallows&quot; - you can tell Christiana thanks for that one.


I about wrecked my car driving home listening to that podcast.   


KEEP UP THE GRRRREEEEAAATTT WORK!


Podcasts have changed the way I listen to the world."/>
			</outline>
		<outline text="Lybia, Syria?">
			<outline text=" Mark Fonseca Rendeiro 	
to Adam
	 More options	  8:53 am (7 hours ago)
Hey Adam.. greetings from the 'dam.  Since timewise Im ahead of the states, I figure Ill be among the first to send one of those typical email-dsc-corrections.  Lockerbie... the Pan-Am bombing.. has been linked to Libya.  And yes.. Qadhafi has accepted responsibility for it.. the nation has also agreed to pay financial compensation to each family.  Couple of million per person. 


Actually its a great example of how to diplomatically engage a country with a controversial leader.. instead of this invade and occupy stuff... these days Qadhafi is really obsessed with his legacy and his image home and abroad.. so he's finally cooperating with the international community.  We could have done the same to saddam... instead of isolating.. engage.. eventually (slowly) changes do occur.


Anyway long-winded correction.  Take care.


-- 
-bicycleMark"/>
